      },
      "questionNumber": "01",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$A=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}],B=[\\begin{matrix}x\\\\ y\\\\ z\\end{matrix}],C=[\\begin{matrix}2\\\\ 5\\\\ 4\\end{matrix}]$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$A\\timesC$ নির্ণেয় করে উহার মাত্রা নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $A=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}]$ এবং $C=[\\begin{matrix}2\\\\ 5\\\\ 4\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴A\\timesC=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}2\\\\ 5\\\\ 4\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2+20+8\\\\ 8+0+12\\\\ 4+15+8\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}30\\\\ 20\\\\ 27\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴A\\timesC$ ম্যাট্রিক্সের মাত্রা $3\\times1$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${A}^{-1}$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $A=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴A$ ম্যাট্রিক্যটি বিপরীতযোগ্য।\n$∴adjA=$ ${[\\begin{matrix}|\\begin{matrix}0 & 3\\\\ 3 & 2\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}4 & 3\\\\ 2 & 2\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}4 & 0\\\\ 2 & 3\\end{matrix}|\\\\ -|\\begin{matrix}4 & 2\\\\ 3 & 2\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & 2\\\\ 2 & 2\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & 4\\\\ 2 & 3\\end{matrix}|\\\\ |\\begin{matrix}4 & 2\\\\ 0 & 3\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & 2\\\\ 4 & 3\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & 4\\\\ 4 & 0\\end{matrix}|\\end{matrix}]}^{t}$\n$\\begin{matrix} & ={[\\begin{matrix}-9 & -2 & 12\\\\ -2 & -2 & 5\\\\ 12 & 5 & -16\\end{matrix}]}^{t}=[\\begin{matrix}-9 & -2 & 12\\\\ -2 & -2 & 5\\\\ 12 & 5 & -16\\end{matrix}]\\\\ & ∴{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|A|}adjA=\\frac{1}{7}[\\begin{matrix}-9 & -2 & 12\\\\ -2 & -2 & 5\\\\ 12 & 5 & -16\\end{matrix}]\\text{ (Ans.) }\\\\ & \\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$A\\timesB=C$ হলে, ক্রেমারের নিয়মে সমীকরণ জোটটি সমাধান কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $AB=C$\nবা, $[\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}x\\\\ y\\\\ z\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2\\\\ 5\\\\ 4\\end{matrix}]∴[\\begin{matrix}x+4y+2z\\\\ 4x+0y+3z\\\\ 2x+3y+2z\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2\\\\ 5\\\\ 4\\end{matrix}]$\nম্যাট্রিক্সের সমতা অনুসারে,\n$x+4y+2z=2$\n$4x+3z=5$\n$2x+3y+2z=$\n$∴D=|\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 3\\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}|$\n$=1(0-9)-4(8-6)+2(12-0)$\n$=-9-8+24=7\\neq0$\n$∴{D}_{x}=|\\begin{matrix}2 & 4 & 2\\\\ 5 & 0 & 3\\\\ 4 & 3 & 2\\end{matrix}|$\n$=2(0-9)-4(10-12)+2(15-0)$\n$=-18+8+30=20$\n${D}_{y}=|\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 2\\\\ 4 & 5 & 3\\\\ 2 & 4 & 2\\end{matrix}|$\n$=1(10-12)-2(8-6)+2(16-10)$\n$=-2-4+12=6$\n${D}_{z}=|\\begin{matrix}1 & 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & 0 & 5\\\\ 2 & 3 & 4\\end{matrix}|$\n$=1(0-15)-4(16-10)+2(12-0)$\n$=-15-24+24=-15$\n$∴x=\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D}=\\frac{20}{7},y=\\frac{{D}_{y}}{D}=\\frac{6}{7},z=\\frac{{D}_{z}}{D}=\\frac{-15}{7}$\n$∴$ নির্ণেয় সমাধান : $(x,y,z)=(\\frac{20}{7},\\frac{6}{7},\\frac{-15}{7})$"
          }
        }
      ],
