      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "দৃশ্যকল্প-I : $f(x)=\\frac{x}{(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)}$\nদৃশ্যকল্প-II : $2{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}=64$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\int\\lnxdx$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\int\\lnxdx=\\lnx\\intdx-\\int[\\frac{d}{dx}(\\lnx)\\intdx]dx$\n$=x\\lnx-\\int\\frac{1}{x}\\cdotxdx$\n$=x\\lnx-\\intdx$\n$=x\\lnx-x+c$ [c যোগজীকরণ ধ্রুবক] (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প-I হতে $\\intf(x)dx$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\intf(x)dx=\\int\\frac{x}{(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)}dx$\nমনেকরি, $\\frac{x}{(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{{x}^{2}+1}$\nউভয়পক্ষকে $(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)$ দ্বারা গুণ করে পাই,\n$x=A({x}^{2}+1)+(Bx+C)(x-1)………$ (i)\n(i) নং $\\Omegax=1$ বসিয়ে,\n$1=2\\text{ }A⇒A=\\frac{1}{2}$\n(i) নং এ $x=0$ বসিয়ে,\n$0=A-C⇒C=A=\\frac{1}{2}$\n(i) নং এর উভয় পক্ষ হতে ${x}^{2}$ এর সহগ সমীকৃত করে পাই,\n$0=A+B⇒B=-A=-\\frac{1}{2}$\n$0=A+B⇒B=-A=-\\frac{1}{2}$\n$∴\\frac{x}{(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{x-1}+\\frac{-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}}{{x}^{2}+1}$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+1}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}$\n$∴\\int\\frac{x}{(x-1)({x}^{2}+1)}dx$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{4}\\int\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1}dx+\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{dx}{{x}^{2}+1}$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|x-1|-\\frac{1}{4}\\ln({x}^{2}+1)+\\frac{1}{2}{\\tan}^{-1}x+c.\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দৃশ্যকল্প-II দ্বারা প্রথম চতুর্ভাগের আবদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রের ক্ষেত্রফল নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$2({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})=64$\nবা, ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=32………$ (i)[IMG_0]\n$∴{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=(\\sqrt{32}{)}^{2}$\nবৃত্তের কেন্দ্র $(0,0)$ এবং ব্যাসার্ধ = $\\sqrt{32}$\n(i) নং হতে পাই, ${y}^{2}=32-{x}^{2}$\n$∴y=\\pm\\sqrt{32-{x}^{2}}$\nপ্রথম চতুর্ভাগে y ধনাত্মক।\n$∴y=\\sqrt{32-{x}^{2}}$\n$∴$ OAB ক্ষের্রের ক্ষেএফল \n$={\\int}_{0}^{\\sqrt{32}}\\sqrt{32-{x}^{2}}dx={\\int}_{0}^{\\sqrt{32}}\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{32}{)}^{2}-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$={[\\frac{x\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{32}{)}^{2}-{x}^{2}}}{2}+\\frac{(\\sqrt{32}{)}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{32}}]}_{0}^{\\sqrt{32}}$\n$=(0+\\frac{32}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}1)-(0+0)$\n$=16\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$=8\\pi$ বর্গ একক (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
